.DS_Store

# Build output. Eleventy writes the deployable site here; Netlify runs the same
# build itself, so nothing in it belongs in the repo.
_site/
node_modules/

# Internal, and this repo is public.
#
# These stay on disk because they only work from here: the option galleries link
# to ../css/style.css and ../assets/, so moving them out of the project root
# would break every one of them. Untracked is enough — the goal is that they are
# not published, not that they are not on the machine.
#
# handoff/ is the exception and has moved out of the project entirely, to
# ../ATD internal/handoff/. It is self-contained, it is a real deliverable, and
# it carries her billing terms, so it should not be one .gitignore typo away
# from being public.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
design-options/
hero-options/
mobile-options/
